hadiths[76]{hadithnumber,text}:
"146","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do lakdiyan lene ka irada kya tha jinhein bajaya jaye taake log namaz ke liye jama hon, phir Abdullah bin Zaid Ansari jo Bani Haris bin Khazraj mein se hain unhein khuwab mein do lakdiyan dikhai gain, to unhon ne kaha ke ye is ke mushabe hain jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chahte hain, to kaha gaya ke kya tum namaz ke liye azan na doge, phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae jab jaage aur Aap se ye bayan kya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne azan ka hukm diya."
"147","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ata bin Yazid Laisi se, unhon ne Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab nida suno to waisa hi kaho jaisa muazzin kehta hai."
"148","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Summa Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman ke azad karda se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar log jaan lein jo nida aur pehli saf mein hai phir is par qura andazi ke siwa na paien to is par qura andazi karein, aur agar jaan lein jo jaldi aane mein hai to is ki taraf daud lagain, aur agar jaan lein jo Isha aur subah mein hai to un dono mein aain chahe ghisat kar."
"149","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ala bin Abdur Rahman bin Yaqub se, unhon ne apne walid se aur Ishaq bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke un dono ne unhein khabar di ke un dono ne Abu Huraira ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab namaz ki iqamat kahi jaye to us ke paas daudte hue na aao, aur us ke paas aao jabke tum par sukoon ho, phir jo pa lo padh lo aur jo faut ho jaye poori kar lo, kyunke tum mein se koi namaz mein hai jab tak namaz ka irada kare."
"150","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Sasaa Ansari phir Mazni se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Abu Saeed Khudri ne un se kaha ke main tumhein bakriyan aur jungle pasand karte dekhta hun, phir jab tum apni bakriyon mein ya jungle mein ho aur namaz ki azan do to nida buland awaz se do kyunke muazzin ki awaz ki intiha ko jinn ya insan ya koi cheez nahi sunti magar qiyamat ke din us ke liye gawahi degi. Abu Saeed ne kaha ke maine use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna."
"151","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab namaz ki nida di jati hai to shaitan peeth pher leta hai aur us ki hawa nikalti hai yahan tak ke nida na sune, phir jab nida poori ho jati hai to aage aata hai yahan tak ke jab namaz ki iqamat kahi jati hai to peeth pher leta hai, yahan tak ke jab iqamat poori ho jati hai to aage aata hai yahan tak ke shakhs aur us ke nafs ke darmiyan khatra dalta hai aur kehta hai ke fulan yad kar fulan yad kar jo wo yad na karta tha, yahan tak ke shakhs na jaane ke kitni padhi."
"152","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Hazim bin Dinar se, unhon ne Sahl bin Saad Saidi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke do ghadiyan hain jin ke liye aasman ke darwaze khole jate hain aur kam hi dua karne wala hai jis ki dua lautayi jati hai, namaz ki nida ke waqt aur Allah ki raah mein saf ke waqt."
"153","Mujhe Malik se riwayat pahunchi ke muazzin Umar bin Khattab ke paas subah ki namaz ki khabar dene aaya aur unhein soya paya to kaha ke namaz neend se behtar hai. To Umar ne unhein hukm diya ke use subah ki nida mein rakhe."
"154","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Abu Suhail bin Malik se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main jin logon ko paya un par jo kuchh tha us mein se namaz ki nida ke siwa kuchh nahi pehchanta."
"155","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne iqamat suni jabke Baqi mein they to masjid ki taraf tez chal kar aae."
"156","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar ne sardi aur hawa wali raat mein namaz ki azan di aur kaha ke khabardaar rehlon mein namaz padho, phir kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muazzin ko hukm dete they ke jab thandi barish wali raat ho to kahe ke khabardaar rehlon mein namaz padho."
"157","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar safar mein iqamat par zyada na karte they magar subah mein, kyunke wo us mein nida dete aur iqamat kehte they, aur kehte they ke azan sirf us imam ke liye hai jis ki taraf log jama hon."
"158","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kya ke un ke walid ne un se kaha ke jab tum safar mein ho to agar chaho azan do aur iqamat kaho to karo, aur agar chaho to iqamat kaho aur azan na do. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke shakhs ke sawaar hote hue azan dene mein koi harj nahi."
"159","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo khule maidan mein namaz padhe to us ke daayen aik farishta namaz padhta hai aur baayen aik farishta, phir jab azan de aur namaz ki iqamat kahe ya iqamat kahe to us ke peechhe farishton mein se pahadon jaisi jamaat namaz padhti hai."
"160","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Bilal raat mein nida dete hain to khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom nida dein."
"161","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Bilal raat mein nida dete hain to khao aur piyo yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Maktoom nida dein. Unhon ne kaha ke Ibn Umm Maktoom nabina shakhs they jo nida na dete they yahan tak ke un se kaha jata ke subah ho gai subah ho gai."
"162","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab namaz shuru karte to dono haath kandhon ke barabar uthate, aur jab ruku se sar uthate to unhein isi tarah uthate aur kehte ke Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne us ki hamd ki, aey hamare Rab tere liye hamd hai. Aur sajde mein aisa na karte they."
"163","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ali bin Husain bin Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz mein takbeer kehte they jab bhi jhukte aur uthte, phir Aap ki namaz yehi rahi yahan tak ke Allah se mile."
"164","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Sulaiman bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz mein dono haath uthate they."
"165","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se riwayat kya ke Abu Huraira unhein namaz padhate aur takbeer kehte jab bhi jhukte aur uthte, phir jab phirte to kehte ke Allah ki qasam main tum mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz se sab se zyada mushabe hun."
"166","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar namaz mein takbeer kehte they jab bhi jhukte aur uthte. Aur mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab namaz shuru karte to dono haath kandhon ke barabar uthate, aur jab ruku se sar uthate to unhein is se kam uthate."
"167","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar namaz mein takbeer kehte they jab bhi jhukte aur uthte. Aur mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab namaz shuru karte to dono haath kandhon ke barabar uthate, aur jab ruku se sar uthate to unhein is se kam uthate."
"168","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Nuaim Wahb bin Kaisan se, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke wo unhein namaz mein takbeer sikhate they. Unhon ne kaha ke wo humein hukm dete they ke takbeer kahein jab bhi hum jhukein aur uthein."
"169","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jab shakhs rakat pa le aur aik takbeer kahe to wo takbeer us ke liye kafi hai. Malik ne kaha ke ye us waqt hai jab wo us takbeer se namaz shuru karne ki niyyat kare. Aur Malik se aik shakhs ke bare mein pucha gaya jo imam ke sath dakhil hua aur shuru ki takbeer aur ruku ki takbeer bhool gaya yahan tak ke aik rakat padh li phir yad aaya ke us ne na shuru ki takbeer kahi thi na ruku ke waqt, aur dusri rakat mein takbeer kahi, to unhon ne kaha ke wo apni namaz se shuru kare ye mujhe zyada pasand hai, aur agar imam ke sath shuru ki takbeer bhool jaye aur pehle ruku mein takbeer kahe to main use us ke liye kafi samajhta hun jab wo us se shuru ki takbeer ki niyyat kare. Malik ne us ke bare mein kaha jo apne liye namaz padhe aur shuru ki takbeer bhool jaye ke wo apni namaz se shuru kare. Aur Malik ne us imam ke bare mein kaha jo shuru ki takbeer bhool jaye yahan tak ke namaz se farigh ho jaye to unhon ne kaha ke main samajhta hun ke wo dohrae aur jo us ke peechhe hain wo namaz dohrain, aur agar jo us ke peechhe hain unhon ne takbeer kahi ho to wo dohrain."
"170","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mutim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein Toor padhte suna."
"171","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utba bin Masud se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke Umm Fadl bint Haris ne unhein suna jabke wo Wal Mursalat Urfa padh rahe they to un se kaha ke aey mere bete tum ne apni is surat ki qirat se mujhe yad dila diya, ye aakhri hai jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein padhte suna."
"172","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Ubaid Sulaiman bin Abdul Malik ke azad karda se, unhon ne Ubada bin Nusa se, unhon ne Qais bin Haris se, unhon ne Abu Abdullah Sanabihi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Abu Bakr Siddiq ki khilafat mein Madina aaya aur un ke peechhe Maghrib padhi aur unhon ne pehli do rakaton mein Ummul Quran aur chhoti mufassal mein se surat surat padhi, phir teesri mein khade hue to main un se qareeb hua yahan tak ke mere kapde un ke kapdon ko chhune lage, phir unhein Ummul Quran aur is aayat padhte suna ke aey hamare Rab hamare dilon ko tedha na kar is ke baad ke tune humein hidayat di aur humein apne paas se rehmat ata farma, beshak tu hi ata karne wala hai."
"173","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab akele namaz padhte to chaaron sab mein har rakat mein Ummul Quran aur Quran mein se surat padhte, aur kabhi farz namaz ki aik rakat mein do ya teen suratein padhte, aur Maghrib ki do rakaton mein isi tarah Ummul Quran aur surat surat padhte."
"174","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Adi bin Sabit Ansari se, unhon ne Bara bin Aazib se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Isha padhi aur Aap ne is mein Wat Teen Waz Zaitoon padhi."
"175","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Hunain se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ali bin Abi Talib se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qassi pehenne se, sone ki angoothi pehenne se aur ruku mein Quran padhne se mana farmaya."
"176","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris Taimi se, unhon ne Abu Hazim Tammar se, unhon ne Bayazi se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke paas nikle jabke wo namaz padh rahe they aur un ki awazein qirat mein buland ho gai thin, to farmaya ke namaz padhne wala apne Rab se sargoshi karta hai to dekhe ke kis se sargoshi karta hai, aur tum mein se baaz baaz par Quran buland na kare."
"177","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Humaid Taweel se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abu Bakr aur Umar aur Usman ke peechhe qayam kya aur sab namaz shuru karte waqt Bismillah hir Rahman nir Raheem na padhte they."
"178","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Abu Suhail bin Malik se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Umar bin Khattab ki qirat Abu Jahm ke ghar ke paas Balat mein sunte they."
"179","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar jab imam ke sath namaz mein se kuchh faut kar lete us mein jis mein imam qirat buland karta to jab imam salam pherta to Abdullah bin Umar khade hote aur jo qaza karte us mein apne liye padhte aur buland karte."
"180","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yazid bin Ruman se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Nafi bin Jubair bin Mutim ke pehlu mein namaz padh raha tha aur wo mujhe chutki kaatte aur main un par kholta jabke hum namaz padh rahe they."
"181","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Abu Bakr Siddiq ne subah padhi aur is mein dono rakaton mein sura Baqara padhi."
"182","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Aamir bin Rabia ko kehte suna ke hum ne Umar bin Khattab ke peechhe subah padhi aur unhon ne is mein sura Yusuf aur sura Hajj aahista qirat se padhi, to maine kaha ke Allah ki qasam jab Fajr nikalti to wo qayam karte they. Unhon ne kaha ke haan."
"183","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se aur Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat kya ke Farafisa bin Umair Hanafi ne kaha ke maine sura Yusuf sirf Usman bin Affan ki subah mein qirat se li, is kasrat se jo wo humein dohrate they."
"184","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar safar mein subah mein mufassal ki pehli das suraton mein se padhte they, har rakat mein Ummul Quran aur surat."
"185","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ala bin Abdur Rahman bin Yaqub se riwayat kya ke Abu Saeed Aamir bin Kuraiz ke azad karda ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ubay bin Kaab ko pukara jabke wo namaz padh rahe they, phir jab namaz se farigh hue to Aap se mile, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna haath un ke haath par rakha jabke Aap masjid ke darwaze se nikalna chahte they, to farmaya ke main ummeed karta hun ke tum masjid se na niklo yahan tak ke surat jaan lo jo Allah ne Taurait mein, na Injeel mein, na Quran mein us jaisi nazil ki. Ubay ne kaha ke maine chalne mein susti ki is ki ummeed se, phir maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah wo surat jo Aap ne mujh se wada ki. Aap ne kaha ke jab tum namaz shuru karo to kaisa padhte ho. Unhon ne kaha ke maine Alhamdu Lillahi Rabbil Aalameen padhi yahan tak ke aakhir tak pahunch gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye yehi surat hai aur yehi Sab al-Masani aur Quran Azeem hai jo mujhe diya gaya."
"186","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Nuaim Wahb bin Kaisan se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna ke jo aik rakat padhe aur us mein Ummul Quran na padhe to us ne namaz nahi padhi magar imam ke peechhe."
"187","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ala bin Abdur Rahman bin Yaqub se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abul Saib Hisham bin Zuhra ke azad karda ko kehte suna ke maine Abu Huraira ko kehte suna ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke jo namaz padhe aur us mein Ummul Quran na padhe to wo khidaj hai, khidaj hai, khidaj hai, poori nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke aey Abu Huraira main kabhi imam ke peechhe hota hun. Unhon ne kaha ke unhon ne meri kalaai dabayi phir kaha ke use apne dil mein padh aey Farsi, kyunke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne kaha ke maine namaz apne aur apne bande ke darmiyan aadhi aadhi taqseem ki, phir aadhi mere liye hai aur aadhi mere bande ke liye, aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke padho, banda kehta hai Alhamdu Lillahi Rabbil Aalameen, Allah Tabarak wa Taala kehta hai mere bande ne meri hamd ki, aur banda kehta hai Ar Rahmanir Raheem, Allah kehta hai mere bande ne meri sana ki, aur banda kehta hai Maliki Yaumid Deen, Allah kehta hai mere bande ne meri buzargi bayan ki, banda kehta hai Iyyaka Nabudu wa Iyyaka Nastayeen, to ye aayat mere aur mere bande ke darmiyan hai aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga, banda kehta hai Ihdinas Siratal Mustaqeem Siratal Lazina Anamta Alaihim Ghairil Maghzoobi Alaihim wa Laz Zaalleen, to ye mere bande ke liye hain aur mere bande ke liye wo hai jo us ne manga."
"188","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke wo imam ke peechhe us mein padhte they jis mein imam qirat buland na karta."
"189","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se aur Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Qasim bin Muhammad imam ke peechhe us mein padhte they jis mein imam qirat buland na karta."
"190","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yazid bin Ruman se riwayat kya ke Nafi bin Jubair bin Mutim imam ke peechhe us mein padhte they jis mein buland qirat na karta. Malik ne kaha ke yehi is mein jo maine suna sab se zyada pasandeeda hai."
"191","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar se pucha jata ke kya koi imam ke peechhe padhe, to kehte ke jab tum mein se koi imam ke peechhe namaz padhe to use imam ki qirat kafi hai, aur jab akele padhe to padhe. Unhon ne kaha ke Abdullah bin Umar imam ke peechhe na padhte they. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke hamare nazdeek hukm ye hai ke shakhs imam ke peechhe us mein padhe jis mein imam qirat buland na kare, aur qirat chhor de us mein jis mein imam qirat buland kare."
"192","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Ibn Ukaima Laisi se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us namaz se phire jis mein qirat buland ki thi aur kaha ke kya abhi tum mein se koi mere sath padh raha tha. To aik shakhs ne kaha ke haan main ya Rasulullah. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main kehta hun mujhe Quran mein kyun jhagda kya jata hai. To log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath us mein qirat se ruk gae jis mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qirat buland karte jab unhon ne ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna."
"193","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se aur Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke un dono ne unhein Abu Huraira se khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab imam aameen kahe to aameen kaho, kyunke jis ka aameen kehna farishton ke aameen kehne ke muwafiq ho us ke agle gunah bakhsh diye jain ge. Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aameen kehte they."
"194","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Summa Abu Bakr ke azad karda se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab imam Ghairil Maghzoobi Alaihim wa Laz Zaalleen kahe to aameen kaho, kyunke jis ka kehna farishton ke kehne ke muwafiq ho us ke agle gunah bakhsh diye jain ge."
"195","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abul Zinad se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi aameen kahe aur aasman mein farishte aameen kahein phir aik dusre ke muwafiq ho to us ke agle gunah bakhsh diye jain ge."
"196","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Summa Abu Bakr ke azad karda se, unhon ne Abu Saleh Samman se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab imam Samiallahu Liman Hamidah kahe to kaho Allahumma Rabbana Lakal Hamd, kyunke jis ka kehna farishton ke kehne ke muwafiq ho us ke agle gunah bakhsh diye jain ge."
"197","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muslim bin Abi Maryam se, unhon ne Ali bin Abdur Rahman Muawi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Abdullah bin Umar ne dekha jabke main namaz mein kankariyon se khel raha tha, phir jab main phira to unhon ne mujhe mana kya aur kaha ke waisa karo jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) karte they. To maine kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kaisa karte they. Unhon ne kaha ke jab namaz mein baithe to daayan hatheli daayen raan par rakhte aur sab ungliyan band kar lete aur us ungli se ishara karte jo angoothe se milti hai, aur baayen hatheli baayen raan par rakhte aur kaha ke isi tarah karte they."
"198","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar ko suna jabke un ke pehlu mein aik shakhs namaz padh raha tha, phir jab shakhs chaar mein baitha to chaukdi maar kar baitha aur dono paon mod liye, phir jab Abdullah phire to us par is ka aib lagaya, to shakhs ne kaha ke Aap aisa karte hain. To Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke main beemar hun."
"199","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Sadaqa bin Yasar se, unhon ne Mughira bin Hakeem se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar ko dekha ke wo namaz mein do sajdon mein apne qadmon ke seenon par laut te they, phir jab phire to un se ye bayan kya gaya to unhon ne kaha ke ye namaz ki sunnat nahi, main aisa sirf is liye karta hun ke main beemar hun."
"200","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke wo Abdullah bin Umar ko dekhte they ke wo namaz mein jab baithe to chaukdi maarte, unhon ne kaha ke maine aisa kya jabke main us waqt kam umr tha, to Abdullah ne mujhe mana kya aur kaha ke namaz ki sunnat yehi hai ke daayan paon khada rakho aur baayan paon modo. To maine un se kaha ke Aap aisa karte hain. To unhon ne kaha ke mere paon mujhe nahi uthate."
"201","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke Qasim bin Muhammad ne unhein tashahhud mein baithna dikhaya, to daayan paon khada rakha aur baayan paon moda aur baayen koolhe par baithe aur qadam par na baithe, phir kaha ke mujhe ye Abdullah bin Abdullah bin Umar ne dikhaya aur unhon ne mujhe bayan kya ke un ke walid aisa karte they."
"202","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Abdul Qari se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Umar bin Khattab ko suna jabke wo mimbar par logon ko tashahhud sikhate they aur kehte they ke kaho Attahiyyatu Lillah Az Zakiyatu Lillah At Tayyibatus Salawatu Lillah Assalamu Alaika Ayyuhan Nabiyyu wa Rahmatullahi wa Barakatuhu Assalamu Alaina wa Ala Ibadillahis Saliheen Ashhadu An La Ilaha Illallah wa Ashhadu Anna Muhammadan Abduhu wa Rasooluhu."
"203","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar tashahhud padhte aur kehte ke Bismillah Attahiyyatu Lillah As Salawatu Lillah Az Zakiyatu Lillah Assalamu Alan Nabi wa Rahmatullahi wa Barakatuhu Assalamu Alaina wa Ala Ibadillahis Saliheen Shahidtu An La Ilaha Illallah Shahidtu Anna Muhammadan Rasoolullah. Ye pehli do rakaton mein kehte aur jab tashahhud poori kar lete to jo chahte dua karte, phir jab aakhri namaz mein baithe to isi tarah tashahhud padhte magar tashahhud ko muqaddam karte phir jo chahte dua karte, phir jab tashahhud poori kar lete aur salam pherna chahte to kehte ke Assalamu Alan Nabi wa Rahmatullahi wa Barakatuhu. Assalamu Alaina wa Ala Ibadillahis Saliheen Assalamu Alaikum apne daayen, phir imam ko lautate, phir agar koi unhein baayen salam kare to use lautate."
"204","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha se riwayat kya ke wo kehti thin ke jab tashahhud padhti to Attahiyyatut Tayyibatus Salawatuz Zakiyatu Lillah Ashhadu An La Ilaha Illallah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lahu wa Anna Muhammadan Abduhu wa Rasooluhu. Assalamu Alaika Ayyuhan Nabiyyu wa Rahmatullahi wa Barakatuhu. Assalamu Alaina wa Ala Ibadillahis Saliheen Assalamu Alaikum."
"205","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed Ansari se, unhon ne Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha kehti thin ke jab tashahhud padhti to Attahiyyatut Tayyibatus Salawatuz Zakiyatu Lillah Ashhadu An La Ilaha Illallah Wahdahu La Shareeka Lahu wa Ashhadu Anna Muhammadan Abdullah wa Rasooluhu Assalamu Alaika Ayyuhan Nabiyyu wa Rahmatullahi wa Barakatuhu Assalamu Alaina wa Ala Ibadillahis Saliheen Assalamu Alaikum."
"206","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Ibn Shihab aur Nafi Ibn Umar ke azad karda se aik shakhs ke bare mein pucha jo imam ke sath namaz mein dakhil hua jabke imam us se aik rakat aage badh chuka ho to kya do aur chaar mein us ke sath tashahhud padhe chahe ye us ke liye taaq ho, to dono ne kaha ke us ke sath tashahhud padhe. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek yehi hukm hai."
"207","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Amr bin Alqama se, unhon ne Malih bin Abdullah Saadi se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke jo imam se pehle sar uthata aur jhukata hai us ki peshani shaitan ke haath mein hai."
"208","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ayyub bin Abi Tamima Sakhtiyani se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Sireen se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) do se phire to Zul Yadain ne un se kaha ke kya namaz qasr ho gai ya Aap bhool gae ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha ke kya Zul Yadain sach kehta hai. To logon ne kaha ke haan. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khade hue aur do rakat aur padhin phir salam phera phir takbeer kahi aur apne sajde jaisa ya is se lamba sajda kya phir sar uthaya phir takbeer kahi aur apne sajde jaisa ya is se lamba sajda kya phir sar uthaya."
"209","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dawood bin Husain se, unhon ne Abu Sufyan Ibn Abi Ahmad ke azad karda se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abu Huraira ko kehte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Asr ki namaz padhi aur do rakat mein salam pher diya, to Zul Yadain khade hue aur kaha ke kya namaz qasr ho gai ya Rasulullah ya Aap bhool gae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha ke ye sab na hua. To unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah is mein se kuchh hua hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha ke kya Zul Yadain sach kehta hai. To unhon ne kaha ke haan. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khade hue aur jo namaz se baqi raha use poora kya phir salam ke baad baithe hue do sajde kiye."
"210","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Sulaiman bin Abi Hathma se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne din ki do namazon mein se aik mein do rakat ruku kya, Zuhr ya Asr, aur do mein salam pher diya, to Zush Shamalain ne un se kaha ke kya namaz qasr ho gai ya Rasulullah ya Aap bhool gae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se kaha ke namaz qasr na hui aur main bhoola nahi. To Zush Shamalain ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah is mein se kuchh hua hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur kaha ke kya Zul Yadain sach kehta hai. To unhon ne kaha ke haan ya Rasulullah. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo namaz se baqi raha use poora kya phir salam phera."
"211","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se aur Abu Salma bin Abdur Rahman se isi tarah riwayat kya. Malik ne kaha ke har bhool jo namaz mein kami ho us ka sajda salam se pehle hai, aur har bhool jo namaz mein zyadati ho us ka sajda salam ke baad hai."
"212","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak kare aur na jaane ke kitni padhi, teen ya chaar, to aik rakat padhe aur baithe hue salam se pehle do sajde kare, phir jo rakat us ne padhi agar paanchwen ho to in dono sajdon se use jod bana de, aur agar chothi ho to dono sajde shaitan ke liye zillat hain."
"213","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Umar bin Muhammad bin Zaid se, unhon ne Salim bin Abdullah se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke jab tum mein se koi apni namaz mein shak kare to jo samjhe ke us ki namaz mein se bhool gaya use ikhtiyar kare aur use padhe phir baithe hue sahw ke do sajde kare."
"214","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Afeef bin Amr Sahmi se, unhon ne Ata bin Yasar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas aur Kaab al-Ahbar se us ke bare mein pucha jo apni namaz mein shak kare aur na jaane ke kitni padhi, teen ya chaar, to dono ne kaha ke aik rakat aur padhe phir baithe hue do sajde kare."
"215","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar se jab namaz mein bhool ke bare mein pucha jata to kehte ke tum mein se koi jo samjhe ke us ki namaz mein se bhool gaya use ikhtiyar kare aur use padhe."
"216","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Aaraj se, unhon ne Abdullah Ibn Buhaina se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne humein do rakat padhain phir khade hue aur na baithe, to log Aap ke sath khade hue, phir jab namaz poori ki aur hum ne Aap ke salam ka intezar kya to takbeer kahi phir baithe hue salam se pehle do sajde kiye phir salam phera."
"217","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Hurmuz se, unhon ne Abdullah Ibn Buhaina se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne humein Zuhr padhai aur do mein khade hue aur un mein na baithe, phir jab namaz poori ki to do sajde kiye phir is ke baad salam phera."
"218","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Alqama bin Abi Alqama se, unhon ne apni walida se riwayat kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha ne kaha ke Abu Jahm bin Huzaifa ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Sham ki naqsh daar chadar tohfe mein di, to Aap ne is mein namaz padhi, phir jab phire to kaha ke ye chadar Abu Jahm ko lauta do kyunke maine is ke naqsh ko namaz mein dekha aur qareeb tha ke mujhe fitne mein dal de."
"219","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sham ki naqsh daar chadar pehni phir use Abu Jahm ko de diya aur Abu Jahm se us ki Anbijaniya le li, to unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah kyun. To farmaya ke maine is ke naqsh ko namaz mein dekha."
"220","Mujhe Malik ne, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke Abu Talha Ansari apne baagh mein namaz padh rahe they aur faqhta udi aur ghoomti rahi nikalne ki jagah talash karti, to unhein ye achha laga aur ghadi bhar us ka peechha apni nazar se karte rahe, phir namaz ki taraf laute to na jaane ke kitni padhi, to kaha ke mere is maal mein mujhe fitna pahunch gaya hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap se jo unhein apne baagh mein fitne se pahuncha use bayan kya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah wo Allah ke liye sadqa hai, use jahan chahein rakhein."
"221","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke Ansar mein se aik shakhs Qaf mein apne baagh mein namaz padh raha tha, jo Madina ki wadiyon mein se aik wadi hai, phal ke zamane mein jab khajoor jhuk gai thi aur apne phal se ghiri hui thi, to us ne us ki taraf dekha aur jo us ne us ke phal mein dekha use achha laga, phir namaz ki taraf lauta to na jaane ke kitni padhi, to kaha ke mere is maal mein mujhe fitna pahunch gaya hai. Phir Usman bin Affan ke paas aaya jo us waqt khalifa they aur un se ye bayan kya aur kaha ke wo sadqa hai, use bhalai ke raaston mein rakho. To Usman bin Affan ne use pachaas hazar mein becha aur us maal ka naam Pachaas rakha gaya."